OL,3,GNEWSADonald Trump continues two-day
OL,4,Avisit of Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump remains in the Republic of
OL,7,FIreland as part of his two-day visit to
OL,8,Fthe country.
OL,10,FThe US president will spend the day at
OL,11,FTrump International Golf Links in
OL,12,FDoonbeg, County Clare for the Irish
OL,13,FOpen.
OL,15,FOn Saturday, he met Ireland's President
OL,16,FCatherine Connolly and the Taoiseach
OL,17,F(Irish PM) Micheal Martin.
OL,19,FTrump told reporters he would love to
OL,20,Fsee a united Ireland while at a meeting
OL,21,Fwith Martin in Dublin.
